Package: kobra-lan-cli
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3 (>= 3.11), python3-cryptography (>= 41)
Description: direct experimental Anycubic Kobra X LAN client
 Inspect local G-code and perform explicitly reviewed uploads and print starts
 with JSON output and durable duplicate protection. Provision direct LAN access
 with explicit initial TLS trust and private configuration storage. Runtime
 cryptography is provided by the distribution's python3-cryptography package.
 Hardware support is experimental and limited to the documented configurations.
